{
  "@derived": "Jagged Alliance 2 source code (SFI-SCLA) via JA2 Stracciatella",
  "@src": [
    "src/game/SaveLoadScreen.cc EnterSaveLoadScreen (interface/loadscreen.sti; the Cancel button from interface/loadscreenaddons.sti 6/9, the action button 5/8 to save or 4/7 to load, hatched when disabled; the NUM_SAVE_GAMES row regions at MSYS_PRIORITY_HIGH, SLG_SAVELOCATION_WIDTH × SLG_SAVELOCATION_HEIGHT from (SLG_FIRST_SAVED_SPOT_X, SLG_FIRST_SAVED_SPOT_Y), SLG_GAP_BETWEEN_LOCATIONS apart; the scroll buttons at SLG_SCROLLBAR_POS_X; the full-screen region at MSYS_PRIORITY_HIGH − 10 for the right click and the wheel), RenderSaveLoadScreen (MLG_LOADSAVEHEADER frame 0 to load, 1 to save, at (SLG_TITLE_POS_X, SLG_TITLE_POS_Y)), RenderScrollBar, DisplaySaveGameEntry (MSG_NEW_SAVE centred in 609 pixels; the fields at the SLG_*_OFFSET_X offsets and SLG_DATE_OFFSET_Y, a selected row one pixel right and up; the colours and shadows per state; the sector shortened to SLG_SECTOR_WIDTH), InitSaveLoadScreenTextInputBoxes (FONT12ARIALFIXEDWIDTH, a black field, the bevel (136,138,135)/(24,61,81), white text and caret, at + SLG_SAVE_GAME_DESC_X, + SLG_SAVE_GAME_DESC_Y − 5, SLG_SAVELOCATION_WIDTH − SLG_SAVE_GAME_DESC_X − 7 by 17, MSYS_PRIORITY_HIGH + 2, 46 characters), GetSaveLoadScreenUserInput (Up and Down on KEY_DOWN and KEY_REPEAT; Escape, Enter and Delete on KEY_UP)",
    "V:SaveLoadScreen.c:117-118 SLG_SELECTED_SLOT_GRAPHICS_NUMBER 3, SLG_UNSELECTED_SLOT_GRAPHICS_NUMBER 2 (the rows of interface/loadscreenaddons.sti, drawn clipped to Stracciatella’s SLG_SAVELOCATION_WIDTH); src/game/Utils/Text.h gs_dead_is_dead_mode_tab_name (the Dead is Dead mark at SLG_SAVE_GAME_SKULL_X in place of Stracciatella’s skull art)"
  ],
  "screen": "saveLoad",
  "frame": "std640",
  "tooltips": true,
  "constants": ["SaveLoadScreen", "Options_Screen"],
